{
  "id": "heating_systems___steam_and_condensate_loads",
  "title": "Heating Systems - Steam and Condensate Loads",
  "description": "Calculate steam and condensate loads for steam heated systems including heat transfer through areas and heating up materials, with support for both heat quantity and heat rate calculations.",
  "type": "chart",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Heating Systems - Steam and Condensate Loads\n\nThis tool calculates steam and condensate loads in steam heated systems for two basic situations:\n\n### 1. Heat Transfer through Areas\n**Q = U × A × dt**\n- Q = quantity of heat transferred through the area\n- U = heat transfer coefficient\n- A = heat transfer area\n- dt = temperature difference between the steam and secondary fluid\n\n### 2. Heating up Materials\n**Q = w × cp × (t₂ - t₁)**\n- w = weight of material\n- cp = specific heat of the heated material\n- t₁ = initial temperature\n- t₂ = final temperature\n\n### Heat Transfer Rate\n**Q' = Q / (L × h)**\n- L = Latent heat of steam\n- h = available time"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Heat Transfer Through Areas",
        "Heating up Materials"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "heat_transfer_coefficient",
          "label": "Heat Transfer Coefficient (U)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "W/m²·K",
          "defaultValue": 500
        },
        {
          "id": "heat_transfer_area",
          "label": "Heat Transfer Area (A)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m²",
          "defaultValue": 10
        },
        {
          "id": "temperature_difference_areas",
          "label": "Temperature Difference (dt)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "K",
          "defaultValue": 50
        },
        {
          "id": "material_weight",
          "label": "Weight of Material (w)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kg",
          "defaultValue": 100
        },
        {
          "id": "specific_heat",
          "label": "Specific Heat (cp)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "J/kg·K",
          "defaultValue": 4186
        },
        {
          "id": "initial_temperature",
          "label": "Initial Temperature (t₁)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "°C",
          "defaultValue": 20
        },
        {
          "id": "final_temperature",
          "label": "Final Temperature (t₂)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "°C",
          "defaultValue": 80
        },
        {
          "id": "latent_heat_steam",
          "label": "Latent Heat of Steam (L)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "J/kg",
          "defaultValue": 2257000
        },
        {
          "id": "available_time",
          "label": "Available Time (h)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "s",
          "defaultValue": 3600
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "heat_transfer_quantity_areas",
          "label": "Heat Quantity - Areas (Q)",
          "formula": "inputs.heat_transfer_coefficient * inputs.heat_transfer_area * inputs.temperature_difference_areas",
          "unit": "J",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "heat_transfer_rate_areas",
          "label": "Heat Rate - Areas (Q')",
          "formula": "(inputs.heat_transfer_coefficient * inputs.heat_transfer_area * inputs.temperature_difference_areas) / (inputs.latent_heat_steam * inputs.available_time)",
          "unit": "kg/s",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "heat_transfer_quantity_materials",
          "label": "Heat Quantity - Materials (Q)",
          "formula": "inputs.material_weight * inputs.specific_heat * (inputs.final_temperature - inputs.initial_temperature)",
          "unit": "J",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "heat_transfer_rate_materials",
          "label": "Heat Rate - Materials (Q')",
          "formula": "(inputs.material_weight * inputs.specific_heat * (inputs.final_temperature - inputs.initial_temperature)) / (inputs.latent_heat_steam * inputs.available_time)",
          "unit": "kg/s",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chart",
      "options": {
        "tooltip": {
          "trigger": "axis"
        },
        "legend": {
          "data": [
            "Heat Transfer - Areas",
            "Heat Transfer - Materials"
          ]
        },
        "xAxis": {
          "type": "category",
          "data": [
            "Heat Quantity (J)",
            "Heat Rate (kg/s)"
          ]
        },
        "yAxis": {
          "type": "value"
        },
        "series": [
          {
            "name": "Heat Transfer - Areas",
            "type": "bar",
            "data": [
              "=heat_transfer_quantity_areas",
              "=heat_transfer_rate_areas"
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "Heat Transfer - Materials",
            "type": "bar",
            "data": [
              "=heat_transfer_quantity_materials",
              "=heat_transfer_rate_materials"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}